class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"dim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scene\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"dim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"party\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"dim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"validity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"justification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"intent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refund_request\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reason_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ITEM_DAMAGED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"facts_used\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"f1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"f2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"f3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"citations\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"returns.br#3.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"buyer_evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"img_ref:upload_88213\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sla_deadline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28T03:14:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>authority_eval</code> 逐维列出结果，让审批人一眼看到&quot;卡在哪一维、差多少&quot;，而不是面对一个含糊的&quot;超出额度&quot;。<code>buyer_evidence</code> 指向买家提供的证据（照片等），让审批人不必回头翻会话。这两个字段是把审批从形式变成实质的关键。</p>\n<h3 id=\"审批的时效与降级\">审批的时效与降级</h3><p>跨境场景下审批人可能在另一个时区，超时是常态。审批流必须有明确的超时行为，且这个行为不能是&quot;自动同意&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>审批等待时长</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 15 分钟</td>\n<td>保持等待，向买家提示&quot;正在为您加急处理&quot;</td>\n<td>正常路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15–60 分钟</td>\n<td>尝试升级到备用审批人/其他时区</td>\n<td>覆盖时差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 60 分钟</td>\n<td>向买家给出<strong>不承诺具体结果</strong>的回复，转入异步跟进</td>\n<td>诚实优于虚假承诺</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行的做法很重要：与其让买家无限等待，不如明确说明&quot;我们正在核实，会在 X 小时内给您答复&quot;，并且<strong>不承诺具体金额</strong>。这既是体验，也避免了&quot;审批最终被拒但买家已被暗示会通过&quot;的争议。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>授权模型是四维约束的合取：额度、角色、场景、时效；额度维度最先评估（最便宜），任一维超出即升级审批。</li>\n<li>额度必须按动作类型分档并做币种归一，同时设买家日累计与系统日总额两道熔断，防止化整为零与系统性错误。</li>\n<li>角色维度要求每次承诺携带承诺主体（平台/卖家/承运商），缺少它的系统会对自营与第三方用同一套额度，两头不适。</li>\n<li>GDPR 第 22 条要求为高影响自动化决策保留人工干预与异议通道，这正是 <code>forbidden_for_ai</code> 档位的合规依据；第 13 条要求披露自动化决策的存在与&quot;有意义的逻辑说明&quot;，应做成由系统字段填充的结构而非模型自由生成。</li>\n<li>EU AI Act 第 50 条要求与自然人交互的 AI 系统明确身份（自 2026 年 8 月 2 日适用）；内部授权控制应对齐 NIST AI RMF 的 Govern–Map–Measure–Manage，把&quot;人机配置&quot;这类风险正式纳入治理而非仅当体验问题。</li>\n<li>审批请求必须携带逐维评估结果与买家证据，并定义超时行为——超时的正确行为是诚实说明与异步跟进，绝不是自动同意。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>授权模型定义了&quot;不该说什么&quot;，但它无法覆盖所有已发生的会话。买家可能会遇到一个既不越权、引用也正确、但语气在这里是禁忌的回答——这类问题只能靠事后审计发现，见 <a href=\"conversation-qa-compliance-review\">会话质检与多市场话术合规</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AI 承诺权限与超额审批边界","id":"ai-承诺权限与超额审批边界"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四维授权模型的具体形态","id":"四维授权模型的具体形态"},{"level":3,"text":"额度：为什么要分档而不是一个上限","id":"额度-为什么要分档而不是一个上限"},{"level":3,"text":"角色：谁在承诺","id":"角色-谁在承诺"},{"level":3,"text":"场景与时效","id":"场景与时效"},{"level":2,"text":"合规接口：GDPR 对自动化决策的要求","id":"合规接口-gdpr-对自动化决策的要求"},{"level":3,"text":"第 22 条：何时构成\"完全自动化决策\"","id":"第-22-条-何时构成-完全自动化决策"},{"level":3,"text":"第 13 条：告知\"有意义的逻辑说明\"","id":"第-13-条-告知-有意义的逻辑说明"},{"level":3,"text":"EU AI Act 的透明性要求","id":"eu-ai-act-的透明性要求"},{"level":3,"text":"风险治理框架的落位","id":"风险治理框架的落位"},{"level":2,"text":"超额审批流的实现","id":"超额审批流的实现"},{"level":3,"text":"审批请求必须携带完整依据","id":"审批请求必须携带完整依据"},{"level":3,"text":"审批的时效与降级","id":"审批的时效与降级"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"政策接地、可追溯引用与幻觉防控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-customer-service-autonomous-ops/hallucination-compliance/policy-grounded-citation-guard"},"next":{"title":"会话质检与多市场话术合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-customer-service-autonomous-ops/hallucination-compliance/conversation-qa-compliance-review"}}